Add CaloCellIndexerSvc.

For efficiency, we want to be able to identify cells via a dense index; this is
done by ICaloIndexer objects.  Add a service to manage these objects: given
a detector ID, or set of detector IDs, it returns an ICaloIndexer object
appropriate for that combination.
